{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Evil Superhero Simulator' is a huge passion project of mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are 'The Crethian'\u00a0 : the only man in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is yours to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">People are your toys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Violence is your religion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a massive procedural open world, flying from city to city, lasering everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with supersonic flight, super strength, and Laser Vision, you will take over this world and destroy its population as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Procedural Dismemberment algorithm allows you laser ANY npc to pieces, in an ultra-realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hear them scream, watch them die with their lasered-off limbs strewn about. They do not stand a chance against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am currently in game development school, and coding the mechanics in this Superhero game have been invaluable. I have wanted to release a Superhero simulator for years!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hope you enjoy! More content is being coded right now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863710?t=1753239853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/6bda96d5da29e4018ad5ce9cd36406609365786c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753239853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/d0fcbfef90811419d83ff9817675fbe99f9a7dc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753239853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/d0fcbfef90811419d83ff9817675fbe99f9a7dc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753239853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You will play as an Evil Superhero who can use his laser eyes and super strength to cut civilians up, and smash them into the sky. The game technically does show 'criminal behavior' in a favorable light, although I do not condone using laser vision to hurt people in real life."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Evil Superhero Simulator' is a huge passion project of mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are 'The Crethian'\u00a0 : the only man in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is yours to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">People are your toys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Violence is your religion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a massive procedural open world, flying from city to city, lasering everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with supersonic flight, super strength, and Laser Vision, you will take over this world and destroy its population as you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Procedural Dismemberment algorithm allows you laser ANY npc to pieces, in an ultra-realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hear them scream, watch them die with their lasered-off limbs strewn about. They do not stand a chance against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am currently in game development school, and coding the mechanics in this Superhero game have been invaluable. I have wanted to release a Superhero simulator for years!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hope you enjoy! More content is being coded right now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Luke Grayson"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/6c0b4967b67a6f330b9545d0dfeaec3d9787f705/header.jpg?t=1753239853","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171613,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171613/movie480.mp4?t=1753050397","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171613/movie_max.mp4?t=1753050397"},"name":"TRAILER_2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171613/bb6a4eab187f685b9a867ba152b40467e7dff209/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753050397","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171613/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753050397","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171613/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753050397"}}],"name":"Evil Superhero Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 5 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 570 / ATI HD 6870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 9 5900<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 870 / AMD R9 270<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Luke Grayson"],